From 3d7a67d722ffabb200bde4c9012d80ad2d85dd5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Theo <theo@local>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:25:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign frontend around the Mubit diagnosis record

Bench view: case queue, incident printout with indexed readings, and a
diagnosis panel whose cited evidence highlights the exact readings it used.
Shows Mubit request ID, model, round trip and raw response, plus the outcome
form. Learning loop view: calls through Mubit, task progress toward a first
adapter, request ledger and score by model. Fonts bundled for offline demos.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EusQhpk2MNdVLzHLFhE7Dc
